      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Recent technological advances in magnetic resonance imaging have transformed the field of magnetic resonance angiography (MRA) from a research tool into an important clinical examination that is gaining acceptance as the screening modality of choice in evaluation of vascular disease. This article describes some of the new techniques and applications of MRA in clinical practice today."},
